{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desktop widget program that can import male/female models and motion files. Supports the Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMD Player</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports importing VMD format</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with Mixamo's FBX for Unity (*.fbx) files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop motion files onto models to apply</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Import</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports MP3/WAV audio files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically binds motions to models after importing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Model Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left or middle mouse button to drag models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyes follow the mouse cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse wheel to zoom in/out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click for context menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a stylish default character.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585600?t=1756089676","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585600?t=1756089676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585600/21666f00cc4070d38813d0d67081cd815deb407c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756089676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585600/21666f00cc4070d38813d0d67081cd815deb407c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756089676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descripti